    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented 2-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in the centre of knock village, located only 300m from Knock Shrine. Knock is within easy reach of the adjoining towns - Ballyhaunis & Claremorris, both with mainline railway stations and is only a 15 minute drive to Ireland West Airport Knock. It offers easy commuting access to Castlebar, Westport and Galway - major employment hubs in the region. Manor Quarter is a very well maintained development.\r\n\r\nSome of its many features include tiled entrance hallway, fireplace in the sitting room, fully fitted kitchen, tiled flooring in the dining room with patio door to the rear garden, timber flooring in all  the bedrooms, fully tiled ensuite,  white double glazed PVC windows and doors, oil fired central heating, front garden, gated side entrance to a generous paved back garden which is easily maintained. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes Entrance Hallway, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Dining Room, Guest WC., 2 Bedrooms, 1 Ensuite, 1 Bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis property would make an ideal family home or investment opportunity and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented 2-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in the centre of knock village, located only 300m from Knock Shrine. Knock is within easy reach of the adjoining towns - Ballyhaunis & Claremorris, both with mainline railway stations and is only a 15 minute drive to Ireland West Airport Knock. It offers easy commuting access to Castlebar, Westport and Galway - major employment hubs in the region. Manor Quarter is a very well maintained development.  Some of its many features include tiled entrance hallway, fireplace in the sitting room, fully fitted kitchen, tiled flooring in the dining room with patio door to the  rear garden, timber flooring in all  the bedrooms, fully tiled ensuite,  white double glazed PVC windows and doors, oil fired central heating, front garden, gated side entrance to a generous paved back garden which is easily maintained.   The accommodation includes Entrance Hallway, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Dining Room, Guest WC., 2 Bedrooms, 1 Ensuite, 1 Bathroom.  This property would make an ideal family home or investment opportunity and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
